Aaaaah!

325
00:21:35,280 --> 00:21:39,280
Goodness! And here I was attempting to restrain myself!

326
00:21:39,280 --> 00:21:41,280
Poor fools! You truly are weak!

327
00:21:41,280 --> 00:21:45,280
Your kingdom as well. It too will fall.

328
00:21:45,280 --> 00:21:47,280
You destroyed them, Master!

329
00:21:47,280 --> 00:21:50,280
Surely only a god could wield such power!

330
00:21:50,280 --> 00:21:55,280
If you wished it, all of the Clover Kingdom's magic knights would cower before you!

331
00:21:58,280 --> 00:22:00,280
No! They live?!

332
00:22:11,280 --> 00:22:17,280
No! They've used their own so on!

